  idQuest: 33
  tenNhiemVu: "D\u1EA1 H\u1ED1ng Lang B\u1EA7y"
  loiThoaiNhanQuest: "\u0110\xEAm \u0111\u1EBFn, ti\u1EBFng h\xFA c\u1EE7a \u0111\xE0n
    s\xF3i tinh qu\u1EF7 d\u1ECB vang v\u1ECDng kh\u1EAFp Tr\xFAc L\xE2m khi\u1EBFn
    ai n\u1EA5y \u0111\u1EC1u kinh h\xE3i. B\u1EA7y s\xF3i nhi\u1EC5m ma kh\xED n\xE0y
    c\u1EF1c k\u1EF3 hung h\xE3n v\xE0 th\xEDch t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng theo \u0111\xE0n.
    Xin h\xE3y qu\xE9t s\u1EA1ch b\u1EA7y s\xF3i n\xE0y gi\xFAp b\xE1 t\xE1nh!"
  loiThoaiDangLam: "Ti\u1EBFng s\xF3i h\xFA v\u1EABn c\xF2n v\u0103ng v\u1EB3ng quanh
    c\xE1c t\xE1n tr\xFAc. \u0110\u1EA1i hi\u1EC7p h\xE3y ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t \u0111\u1EE7
    10 con s\xF3i ma \u0111\u1EC3 mang l\u1EA1i b\xECnh y\xEAn cho \u0111\xEAm t\u1ED1i!"
  loiThoaiHoanThanh: "\u0110\xEAm nay d\xE2n l\xE0ng \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 k\xEA
    cao g\u1ED1i ng\u1EE7 m\xE0 kh\xF4ng s\u1EE3 b\u1EA7y th\xFA d\u1EEF x\xE9 r\xE0o
    v\xE0o th\xF4n. \u0110a t\u1EA1 c\xF4ng \u0111\u1EE9c c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1EA1i
    hi\u1EC7p!"
